<title>USA: WinStar to offer local service in Okla..</title>
<headline>WinStar to offer local service in Okla..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>WinStar Communications Inc said Wednesday the state of Oklahoma has authorized the company to provide competitive local exchange telecommunications services.</p>
<p>WinStar now has certifications in 22 jurisdictions, representing 34 major markets, for competitive local telecommunications service, it said.</p>
</text>
